{title: Mera Inteqam Dekhegi}
{artist: Anand Raj Anand Krishna}
{key: Fm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Fm],        Jo dil mein bhara tune
[A#m] [D#] [Cm],        Dekhegi uss zeher ko
[Fm],        Bhugtegi mere gham ko
[A#m] [D#] [Cm],        Meri aah ke kahar ko
[D#] [Cm],        Apni khudgarzi ka ab
[C#] [Fm],        anzaam dekhegi
[Fm] [C#],        Thukra ke mera pyaar
[D#] [Fm],        Mera intkam dekhegi ..x2
[Fm] [A#m],        Chahat ka sila zaalim
[D#] [G#],        Matlab hi diya tune
[Fm] [A#m],        Majboor na thi phir bhi
[D#] [Cm],        Dhokha kiya tune
[D#] [Cm],        Nafrat ko meri ab tu
[C#] [Fm],        Subah shaam dekhegi
[Fm] [C#],        Thukra ke mera pyaar
[D#] [Fm],        Mera intkam dekhegi ..x2
[Fm] [A#m],        Tune har sitam jo mujhpe
[D#] [G#],        Kuch soch ke kiya hai
[Fm] [A#m],        Kudrat ne sila uska
[D#] [Cm],        Aakhir tujhe diya hai
[D#] [Cm],        Duniya shikast teri
[C#] [Fm],        sar-e-aam dekhegi
[Fm] [C#],        Thukra ke mera pyaar
[D#] [Fm],        Mera intkam dekhegi ..x2
